OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Flargely dry night with clear spells.
OL,7,FHowever, fog and frost are also likely
OL,8,Fto form, the fog becoming most
OL,9,Fwidespread and locally dense in the
OL,10,Feast. Meanwhile, turning breezy with
OL,11,Fpatchy rain in the southwest later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FFog and frost lifting on
OL,14,FTuesday, leaving some brighter breaks
OL,15,Fin the northeast. However, cloud will
OL,16,Fthicken from the southwest through the
OL,17,Fday with generally wet and breezy
OL,18,Fconditions developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
